%% The status a run's run.json can hold, and what moves it from one to the next.
%% Shown in docs/engineering/runs.md.
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> submitted: submit.sh or run_local.sh creates the run
  submitted --> running: the job (or local run) starts
  submitted --> failed: the job's environment check fails, before the command starts
  submitted --> [*]: submission fails, the run folder is removed
  running --> completed: the command exits with 0
  running --> failed: the command, or a check before it, exits with another code
  running --> timeout: 2 minutes before the time limit (cluster)
  running --> canceled: scancel, a node problem, or Ctrl-C (local)
  running --> stopped: Slurm stops it, reason unknown
  completed --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  timeout --> [*]
  canceled --> [*]
  stopped --> [*]
